{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-20-1","title":"Proverbs 20:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>2Sa 13:28; 1Ki 20:16-21; Isa 28:7; Ho 4:11; 7:5; Hab 2:15,16 1Co 6:10; Ga 5:21; Eph 5:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-2","title":"Proverbs 20:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>fear. 16:14,15; 19:12; Ec 10:4; Ho 11:10; Am 3:8 sinneth. 8:36; 1Ki 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-3","title":"Proverbs 20:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>an. 14:29; 16:32; 17:14; 19:11; 25:8-10; Eph 1:6-8; 4:32; 5:1 but. 14:17; 18:6; 21:24; 2Ki 14:9; Jas 3:14; 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-4","title":"Proverbs 20:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>sluggard. 10:4; 19:15,24; 26:13-16 cold. or, winter. therefore. 6:10,11; 19:15; 24:34; Mt 25:3-10,24-28; 2Pe 1:5-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-5","title":"Proverbs 20:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>18:4; Ps 64:6; 1Co 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-6","title":"Proverbs 20:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>proclaim. 25:14; 27:2; Mt 6:2; Lu 18:8,11,28; 22:33; 2Co 12:11 goodness. or, bounty. but. Ps 12:1; Ec 7:28; Jer 5:1; Mic 7:2; Lu 18:8; Joh 1:47</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-7","title":"Proverbs 20:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>just. 14:2; 19:1; Ps 15:2; 26:1,11; Isa 33:15; Lu 1:6; 2Co 1:12 Tit 2:11,12; 3Jo 1:3,4 his children. 13:22; Ge 17:7; Ps 37:26; 112:2; Jer 32:39; Ac 2:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-8","title":"Proverbs 20:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>26; 16:12; 29:14; 1Sa 23:3,4; 2Sa 23:4; Ps 72:4; 92:9; 99:4; 101:6-8 Isa 32:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-9","title":"Proverbs 20:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>1Ki 8:46; 2Ch 6:36; Job 14:4; 15:14; 25:4; Ps 51:5; Ec 7:20; 1Co 4:4 Jas 3:2; 1Jo 1:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-10","title":"Proverbs 20:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Divers weights, and divers measures. Heb. a stone and astone, an ephah and an ephah. De 25:13 both. 23; 11:1; 16:11; Le 19:35; De 25:13-15; Am 8:4-7 Mic 6:10,11 abomination. De 7:25,26; Re 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-11","title":"Proverbs 20:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>21:8; 22:15; Ps 51:5; 58:3; Mt 7:16; Lu 1:15,66; 2:46,47; 6:43,44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-12","title":"Proverbs 20:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Ex 4:11; Ps 94:9; 119:18; Mt 13:13-16; Ac 26:18; Eph 1:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-13","title":"Proverbs 20:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Love. 6:9-11; 10:4; 12:11; 13:4; 19:15; 24:30-34; Ro 12:11; 2Th 3:10 open. Jon 1:6; Ro 13:11; 1Co 15:34; Eph 5:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-14","title":"Proverbs 20:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>It is naught. Ec 1:10; Ho 12:7,8; 1Th 4:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-15","title":"Proverbs 20:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>but. 3:15; 8:11; 10:20,21; 15:7,23; 16:16,21,24; 25:12; Job 28:12-19 Ec 12:9-11; Ro 10:14,15; Eph 4:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-16","title":"Proverbs 20:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Take his. 11:15; 22:26,27; 27:13; Ex 22:26,27 a strange. 2:16; 5:3; 7:5,10; 23:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-17","title":"Proverbs 20:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>deceit. Heb. lying, or falsehood. 4:17 is sweet. 9:17,18; Ge 3:6,7; Job 20:12-20; Ec 11:9; Heb 11:25 his. La 3:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-18","title":"Proverbs 20:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>purpose. 15:22; 24:6 and. 25:8; Jud 1:1,2; 9:29; 20:7,18,23,26-28; 2Sa 2:26,27; 2Ch 25:17-23 Lu 14:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-19","title":"Proverbs 20:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>that goeth. 11:13; 18:8; 26:20-22; Le 19:16 meddle. 24:21 flattereth. or, enticeth. 16:29; Ro 16:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-20","title":"Proverbs 20:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>curseth. 30:11,17; Ex 20:12; 21:17; Le 20:9; De 27:16; Mt 15:4; Mr 7:10-13 his. 13:9; 24:20; Job 18:5,6,18; Mt 22:13; 25:8; Jude 1:13 lamp. or, candle. 27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-21","title":"Proverbs 20:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>gotten. 23:4; 28:20,22; 1Ti 6:9 but. 13:22; 28:8; Job 27:16,17; Hab 2:6; Zec 5:4; Mal 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-22","title":"Proverbs 20:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>I. 17:13; 24:29; De 32:35; Ro 12:17-19; 1Th 5:15; 1Pe 3:9 wait. 2Sa 16:12; Ps 27:14; 37:34; Isa 40:31; La 3:25,26; 1Pe 2:23; 4:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-23","title":"Proverbs 20:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>weights. 10; Eze 45:10 a false balance. Heb. balances of deceit. Ho 12:7; Am 8:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-24","title":"Proverbs 20:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Man's. Ps 37:23; Jer 10:23; Da 5:23; Ac 17:28 how. 14:8; 16:9; Ps 25:4,12; Isa 10:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-25","title":"Proverbs 20:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>a snare. 18:7; Le 5:15; 22:10-15; 27:30; Mal 3:8-10 after. Le 27:9,10,31; Nu 30:2-16; Ec 5:4-6; Mt 5:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-26","title":"Proverbs 20:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>wise. 8; 2Sa 4:9-12; Ps 101:5-8 bringeth. 2Sa 12:31; Isa 28:27,28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-27","title":"Proverbs 20:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>spirit. Ge 2:7; Job 32:8; Ro 2:15; 1Co 2:11; 2Co 4:2-6; 1Jo 3:19-21 candle. or, lamp. 20 searching. 30; Heb 4:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-28","title":"Proverbs 20:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Mercy. 16:6 See on Ps 61:7; 101:1 his. 16:12; 29:14; Ps 21:7; 26:1; Isa 16:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-29","title":"Proverbs 20:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>glory. Jer 9:23,24; 1Jo 2:14 the beauty. 16:31; Le 19:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-20-30","title":"Proverbs 20:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":20,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":20,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>cleanseth away evil. Heb. is a purging medicine againstevil. stripes. 19:25; 22:15; Isa 27:9; Heb 12:10</p>"}]}